  "cheatNotes": [
    "_` Random Select",
    "- On the Character Select Screen ^8 and press _S",
    "_` 2nd, 3rd, 4th, 5th and 6th Color",
    "- On the Character Select Screen, press _2 / _8",
    "_` Speed Select",
    "- On the Character Select Screen, press:",
    "- Normal Speed                   ^2_+_O^H",
    "- Fast Speed                     ^2_+_O^I",
    "- Ultra Speed                    ^2_+_O^J",
    "_` Stage and Music Select",
    "- On the Character Select Screen press:",
    "- Sabrewulf's Lair               ^8_+_O^E",
    "- Maya's Jungle                  ^8_+_O^F",
    "- Glacius's Crash Site           ^8_+_O^G",
    "- Tusk's Stone Henge             ^8_+_O^H",
    "- Fulgore's Museum               ^8_+_O^I",
    "- Orchid's Helipad               ^8_+_O^J",
    "- Jago's Bridge                  ^2_+_O^E",
    "- Gargos's Castle                ^2_+_O^F",
    "- Combo's Street                 ^2_+_O^G",
    "- Kim Wu's Dojo                  ^2_+_O^H",
    "- Pirate Ship                    ^2_+_O^I",
    "- Sky Stage                      ^2_+_O^I on both sides",
    "- Spinal's Ship                  ^2_+_O^J",
    "- The 1st player who done the code will select the Stage",
    "- The 2nd player who done the code will select the Music",
    "- Only on a 2P Game",
    "_` Easy Combo Breaker Mode",
    "- On the vs. Screen ^2_+_O_S on both sides",
    "- Only on a 2P Game",
    "_` High Scores Table",
    "- During the Attractive Mode press _8"
  ],
